<title>USA: Wiser Oil sells $100 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>Wiser Oil sells $100 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A private placement debt issue from Wiser Oil Co was priced on Friday via Salomon Brothers Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Wiser is an oil and gas producer and wholesaler in the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>BORROWER WISER OIL CO</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	 COUPON 9.50 PCT   MATURITY 5/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 99.718  FIRST PAY DATE 11/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 9.545 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD 287.5 BP   CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTE: Three year equity call for 1/3 issue at par plus coupon</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
</text>
